1d:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body ","children":[false,[["$","section","Check the practical details first",{"id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check the practical details first"}],[["$","p","A prestigious name does not automatically make an internship accessible. Before writing an application, confirm enrolment rules, nationality restrictions, work location, visa support, pay and start date.",{"children":"A prestigious name does not automatically make an internship accessible. Before writing an application, confirm enrolment rules, nationality restrictions, work location, visa support, pay and start date."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Current-student or recent-graduate requirement",{"children":"Current-student or recent-graduate requirement"}],["$","li","On-site, hybrid or remote arrangement",{"children":"On-site, hybrid or remote arrangement"}],["$","li","Monthly stipend and relocation support",{"children":"Monthly stipend and relocation support"}],["$","li","Visa and work-authorisation responsibility",{"children":"Visa and work-authorisation responsibility"}],["$","li","Expected hours and programme duration",{"children":"Expected hours and programme duration"}]]}]]}],["$","section","How AspireCompass verifies listings",{"id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How AspireCompass verifies listings"}],[["$","p","We summarise eligibility, funding and timing from the programme owner whenever an official page is available. Every listing shows the source and the date it was last checked.",{"children":"We summarise eligibility, funding and timing from the programme owner whenever an official page is available. Every listing shows the source and the date it was last checked."}],["$","p","Scholarship and recruitment details can change without notice. Always read the official call, confirm the deadline in your time zone and apply through the programme owner's portal. AspireCompass does not award scholarships or charge an application fee.",{"children":"Scholarship and recruitment details can change without notice. Always read the official call, confirm the deadline in your time zone and apply through the programme owner's portal. AspireCompass does not award scholarships or charge an application fee."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Make the placement financially and legally workable",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Make the placement financially and legally workable"}],[["$","p","A paid internship can still be unaffordable if the stipend does not cover the location, travel, insurance or visa. Calculate the full placement cost and confirm whether the employer provides immigration support before accepting.",{"children":"A paid internship can still be unaffordable if the stipend does not cover the location, travel, insurance or visa. Calculate the full placement cost and confirm whether the employer provides immigration support before accepting."}],["$","p","Some international organisations use nationality or membership-country rules, and these can change. CERN currently notes nationality ceilings for several countries, including Pakistan, on selected internship and graduate routes; the live programme page is the final authority.",{"children":"Some international organisations use nationality or membership-country rules, and these can change. CERN currently notes nationality ceilings for several countries, including Pakistan, on selected internship and graduate routes; the live programme page is the final authority."}]],"$undefined"]}],"$L21"]]}]
